  "final_message": "The bug was in `records_in_period` in [billing/usage.py](/tmp/bsvc-6zqq8gkv/billing-service/billing/usage.py:34). Usage timestamps are stored in milliseconds, but the function compared them with billing period boundaries in seconds, so renewal invoices found no usage.\n\nI converted the boundaries to milliseconds, added a regression test covering renewal quantities and the period boundary, and wrote [answer.json](/tmp/bsvc-6zqq8gkv/billing-service/answer.json). All 25 tests pass.",
